  "story": {
    "day": 135,
    "title": "A Day at Skate Camp",
    "sentences": [
      "Yesterday was December fourteenth, the first day of Kaya's winter camp.",
      "Kaya felt sad because her friend was absent with a little fever.",
      "She began to worry, but their bus arrived safely in bad weather.",
      "Her friends weren't with her, so Kaya was scared to skate alone.",
      "However, she didn't want to lose the race and did her best.",
      "Soon, many students were tired after a long practice.",
      "During lunch, Kaya checked the sound setting on her smartphone for messages.",
      "Later, the camp shop had a chicken sale, but she wasn't hungry.",
      "Then, a friendly interviewer gave warm greetings to everybody.",
      "He turned his attention to Kaya and said, \"You made a big difference!\"",
      "A happy smile began to appear as Kaya skated back onto the ice."
    ]
  }
}